1
00:00:00,347 --> 00:00:02,377
(Raj:)You know, he might not reopen.

2
00:00:02,383 --> 00:00:05,253
(Raj:)He didn't get a lot of money
from the insurance company.

3
00:00:05,252 --> 00:00:07,922
(Sheldon:)Oh, boy, if there is one thing
that gets my goat,

4
00:00:07,921 --> 00:00:11,161
(Sheldon:)it's those dad-gum
insurance companies.

5
00:00:11,158 --> 00:00:13,628
(Leonard:)Why? Because they won't
get off your lawn?

6
00:00:17,097 --> 00:00:21,837
Oh, is Stuart trying to get a
loan, or-or find investors?

7
00:00:21,835 --> 00:00:23,865
(Howard:)All I know is,
he's got my mother

8
00:00:23,871 --> 00:00:26,741
(Howard:)buying four-ply toilet paper.
I mean, four-ply.

9
00:00:27,908 --> 00:00:29,338
(Howard:)If his butt is so delicate,

10
00:00:29,343 --> 00:00:31,543
(Howard:)why doesn't he just use
an angora rabbit?

11
00:00:32,746 --> 00:00:35,616
(Sheldon:)For starters,
they shed and bite.

12
00:00:36,550 --> 00:00:38,380
LEONARD:
Hey,

13
00:00:38,385 --> 00:00:39,885
(Leonard:)here's a thought.

14
00:00:39,887 --> 00:00:42,217
(Leonard:)Why don't we put up the rest
of the money that Stuart needs?

15
00:00:43,490 --> 00:00:46,960
(Raj:)So, we'd be, like, owners
of a comic book store?

16
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,590
(all chuckling)

17
00:00:48,595 --> 00:00:50,395
(Leonard:)It's kind of a
dream come true.

18
00:00:50,397 --> 00:00:51,867
(Howard:)That does sound fun.

19
00:00:51,865 --> 00:00:53,435
(Raj:)Ooh, maybe we could come up

20
00:00:53,434 --> 00:00:55,904
(Raj:)with a business plan
to compete with this place.

21
00:00:55,903 --> 00:00:57,873
(Sheldon:)I'll give you a plan right now.

22
00:00:57,871 --> 00:01:00,301
Step one:
open comic book store.

